@page "/getting-started"

<PageTitle>Getting Started - BaseRz</PageTitle>

<h1>Getting Started</h1>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">1. Install</h2>
<pre><code>dotnet add package BaseRz.Core</code></pre>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">2. Register services</h2>
<p>In <code>Program.cs</code> (or <code>MauiProgram.cs</code>):</p>
<pre><code>builder.Services.AddBaseRz();</code></pre>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">3. Optional reset</h2>
<p>For a neutral baseline across browsers and WebViews, add to <code>index.html</code> or <code>App.razor</code>:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;link href="_content/BaseRz.Core/css/baserz-reset.css" rel="stylesheet" /&gt;</code></pre>

<p>
    Direction for keyboard navigation defaults to <code>@Options.DefaultDirection</code>.
    Configure it with <code>AddBaseRz(o =&gt; o.DefaultDirection = Direction.Rtl)</code>.
</p>

@code {
    [Inject] private BaseRzOptions Options { get; set; } = default!;
}
